Subject: [PATCH] mac80211: use common cleanup for user/!user_mpm
Date: Sat, 25 Jun 2016 19:14:16 -0400
Message-Id: <20160625231416.19488-1-me@bobcopeland.com> (sfid-20160626_011448_284091_D5273D13)
Sender: linux-wireless-owner@vger.kernel.org
